CUFSM, MIT-licensed, Copyright (c) 2026 Matthew Campbell, compiled to WebAssembly as
cufsm.wasm. cufsm-rs and CivilKit Buckling are an independent port, not affiliated with or
endorsed by the CUFSM authors.

It also includes third-party software under their own licences, among them MicroPython,
fflate and the cufsm-rs-py Python package, and the Python console can download Pyodide with
